589→    // After reload, the Zustand store is wiped so quota resets to 0.
590→    // The StorageQuota component should fetch fresh quota from the backend
591→    // once auth is restored, showing the same non-zero value as before reload.
592→    // This is a regression test for the quota-stuck-at-zero bug.
