 11→/**
 12→ * Recycle Bin E2E Test Suite
 13→ *
 14→ * Verifies the full recycle bin lifecycle end-to-end:
 15→ * 1. Delete a file from the file browser -> file moves to bin
 16→ * 2. Navigate to the bin -> deleted file is visible with metadata
 17→ * 3. Restore a file from the bin -> file reappears in file browser
 18→ * 4. Permanently delete a file from the bin -> file is gone forever
 19→ * 5. Empty the bin -> all items removed
 20→ * 6. Sidebar navigation to bin works
 21→ *
 22→ * Depends on:
 23→ * - Plan 17-01: Bin crypto primitives (HKDF derivation, ECIES encrypt/decrypt)
 24→ * - Plan 17-02: Bin store and API integration
 25→ * - Plan 17-03: Bin UI components (BinBrowser, BinListItem, BinEmptyState)
 26→ */
